                        <field name="dc_title">St. Gallen, Stiftsbibliothek, Cod. Sang. 1280 : Manuscript catalog by Father Hermann Schenk from the period around 1700 – Register of abbey library benefactors from 1567 until about 1780 – Various special lists of the abbey library’s printed books, compiled between about 1696 and about 1762. </field>
